Z||000000||87GT||04-11-2000||09:10 PM||||Well guys/gals today is the one year anniversary of getting my 87GT!  What a year its been too!  I drive it daily and am happy to say my only problem with it was a bad tach filter.  I unplugged it and plugged it back in a week later and it fixed itself! How about that? I registered on Pennocks last May when there were only like 40 or 50 members, its amazing to see how much it has grown over the last year. Thanks to everyone who helped me with any questions I have asked over the year.  Anyways, I am so glad I bought that little shoe box car out there, its been so good to me. 8-)||||reg||1
Z||000001||wkayl||04-11-2000||09:49 PM||||My 1 year anniv. will be in the 2nd week of June.  Yesterday I was on the return leg of a 6oo mile trip and it hit 10,000 miles that I have put on it.||||reg||1
